      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012174650109776045",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "对“起号”这种行为，我一直嗤之以鼻。\n\n我对社交从来都是以寻觅其中的乐趣为主，希望这种体验是丰富的，我希望整个成长过程都循序渐进、有迹可循。我不期望自己能够火起来，因为我没有相应的心理准备。\n\n但是“起号”会打破这种连续性，也会牺牲掉真实感。",
    "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:46:35.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 1,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 10,
      "impression_count": 10
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012172226150154429",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "Skills值了的AI概念确实很好，但是它可能会牺牲掉重复带来的奇妙体验，只能泛泛地、粗浅地去看待某件事情。\n\n或许，专家这种事物真的会消失。",
    "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:36:57.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 0,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 21,
      "impression_count": 21
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012171906338725923",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "有人说重复是一种很傻的行为，但是如果对一件事情可以忍受其重复，甚至乐此不疲的时候，可能需要注意，因为你可能在这方面存在天赋。\n\n我相信任何事情，即便是在重复地做，每一遍的实际体验也是不一样的，能够获得的经验也会有所出入。如果能够重复几十上百次，对此事会形成很丰富的认知视角。",
    "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:35:41.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 1,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 1,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 19,
      "impression_count": 19
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012169395246678395",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "推文可以成为碎片收集器。\n\n我处理的方法大概就是：\n\n1. 很任性地发了一堆内容，观点非常零散，但终归是我本人的观点。\n\n2. 定期下载备份推文，然后时不时地把之前写的东西读一读。\n\n3. 感觉有些主题的内容已经足够丰富，将其汇总一下，理一理主线和素材。\n\n4. 写长文",
    "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:25:42.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 0,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "view_count": 21,
      "impression_count": 21
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2012167834370183236",
    "author": {
      "id": "1495931005857046528",
      "username": "Linguista2025",
      "name": "Linguista",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2007818475818061824/EyNsNuqE_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "我应该尽量减少碎片化的评论。\n\n既然我喜欢写深度内容, 那就没必要把宝贵的评论资源浪费在碎片化的评论上。",
    "created_at": "2026-01-16T14:19:30.000Z",
    "metrics": {
